               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Create Teams: Each team will need at least one â€œactorâ€ and one </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Create Teams: Each team will need at least one â€œactorâ€ and one â€œguesser.â€ Prepare Cards: Carefully cut out the character charade cards and place them in a hat or bowl. Pick a Card: Taking turns, each teamâ€™s actor will pick a card. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Lights, Camera, Action! As the teamâ€™s actor impersonates their </photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Lights, Camera, Action! As the teamâ€™s actor impersonates their character, the teamâ€™s guesser is given three minutes to guess the correct character. Scoring: Guessing your teammateâ€™s character right is a point! First team to 3 points wins Muppets Character Charades.</photoshop:LayerText>
